// 2×2 nearest on low) two candidate segments, each present iff its hash < 0.6·w_r: random orientation, half-length
// 0.2–1 cell, width w_s 2–4 µm. Pixel coverage cov = w_s·N₁(dist; σ⊥)·(end taper), σ⊥ = max(sigmaAlong(F, n̂_s), w_s).
